_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:29:**Today (verified):** [approved slices](../ROADMAP.md#vertical-slices) includes both maps at 23; Q2.2 in [Core rows](../docs/decisions.md#decided-2026-11-05-core) excludes HashMap from the initial Destroy inventory; Q2.3 specifies OrderedMap destruction order. Q9.2/Q9.6 distinguish ordinary owning definitions from irreducible primitives.
_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:51:**Today (verified):** [OD79](../docs/decisions.md#od79) extended by [SPARK](../docs/decisions.md#decided-project-spark-2026-11-06) adds assert(e) by thm(...); [no hidden traps](../docs/decisions.md#decided-project-no-hidden-traps) defines function-level #[proof(path)].
_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:62:**Today (verified):** [OD25](../docs/decisions.md#od25)/[OD84](../docs/decisions.md#od84)/[OD130](../docs/decisions.md#od130) establish named patterns and explicit ignore handling; expression puns remain proposed in grammar OPEN-20, not a separately verified deciding row.
