_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:91:**Today (verified):** [OD12](../docs/decisions.md#od12) distinguishes contract mathematics from machine arithmetic; [OD145](../docs/decisions.md#od145) selects named ARITH-4 machine operations inside contracts.
