_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:201:**Today (verified):** [TYPE-20](../legacy/docs/spec/types.md#TYPE-20) defines a byte code unit and u8 round trips; [OD137](../docs/decisions.md#od137) restricts literal characters to ASCII; [OD42](../docs/decisions.md#od42) defines comparisons.
