_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:365:**Today (verified):** [OD1](../docs/decisions.md#od1)/[OD58](../docs/decisions.md#od58)/[OD36](../docs/decisions.md#od36), Q3/Q4.7/Q9.5 in [Core rows](../docs/decisions.md#decided-2026-11-05-core) distinguish call-duration loans and scoped heap/array/text views.
_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:376:**Today (verified):** [OD2](../docs/decisions.md#od2)/[OD60](../docs/decisions.md#od60)/[OD69](../docs/decisions.md#od69)/[OD144](../docs/decisions.md#od144) and Q2.1 in [Core rows](../docs/decisions.md#decided-2026-11-05-core) separate scheduling, destruction and resource cleanup.
_review/SIMPLIFY_MERGED.md:387:**Today (verified):** [OD28](../docs/decisions.md#od28)/[OD59](../docs/decisions.md#od59)/[OD60](../docs/decisions.md#od60), Q2 in [Core rows](../docs/decisions.md#decided-2026-11-05-core), and [information flow](../docs/decisions.md#decided-project-infoflow-2026-11-06) fix distinct obligations.
